  "notes": "Image titled LILYGO T-PicoC3 Pinmap (RP2040 + ESP32-C3 + ST7789V 1.14 inch). The top four left-header pins (IO9, IO8, IO2, RST) and the GND below RST are grouped in a box captioned ESP32C3 PIN; the rest are captioned RP2040 PIN. These group captions are category tags and not added to functions. Silkscreen IO9/IO8/IO2 read with the letter O by context. Skipped: ST7789V display assignments (MOSI GP3, SCLK GP2, CS GP5, DC GP1, RST GP0, BL GP4), Battery capacity detection IO26 (not tied to a pin), IPEX antenna, BOOT/GPIO6/GPIO7/RP2040 reset buttons, LEDs, USB-C."
